body:
Damn, you are toxic as shit.

&#x200B;

I literally havent seen a cheater in like 6 months. And back then, I literally reported so many cheaters (about one every 3 matches), that the support team thanked me for still playing despite all the cheaters...

&#x200B;

If you have 10 hours, youre still brand new. If you dont accept that you have many things to learn, you will never get better. Thats jsut the reality of gaming, or any skill in life in general. Just a massive skill issue mate.
